    Cross-platform build configuration for Linux.
    The Microsoft.NETFramework.ReferenceAssemblies.net48 package (in csproj) provides
    the .NET Framework reference assemblies needed for building on Linux.

    NOTE: Do NOT override AssemblySearchPaths here as it breaks HintPath resolution
    for TaleWorlds DLL references.
  -->
</Project>
